        </handlers>
        <extendedTooltip>
          <name>ShowScannerDialogExtendedTooltip</name>
          <id>144</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>&lt;b>Basic&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>settings:&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> Do not display the scanner dialog box and apply the settings specified in the application. 
&lt;b>Advanced&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>settings:&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> Display the scanner dialog box to configure additional device-specific settings.
</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>&lt;b>تنظیمات&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>پایه:&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> کادر محاوره اسکنر نمایش داده نمی‌شود و تنظیمات مشخص‌شده در برنامه اعمال می‌شوند. 
&lt;b>تنظیمات&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>پیشرفته:&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> کادر محاوره اسکنر برای پیکربندی تنظیمات تکمیلی مخصوص دستگاه نمایش داده می‌شود.
</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>&lt;b>Основные&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>в&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>приложении&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>-&lt;/> диалог сканера не открывается, а применяются настройки, заданные в приложении.
&lt;b>Расширенные&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>в&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>диалоге&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>сканера&lt;/> - отображается диалог сканера, в котором можно задать другие дополнительные настройки, специфичные для конкретного устройства.
</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>&lt;b>Uygulamadaki&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>temel&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>olanlar&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>;&lt;/> tarayıcı iletişim kutusu açılmaz, ancak uygulamada yapılandırılan ayarlar uygulanır.
&lt;b>Tarayıcı&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>iletişim&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>kutusundaki&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>uzantılar&lt;/> ; cihaza özel diğer ek ayarların yapılabileceği tarayıcı iletişim kutusu görüntülenir.
</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>&lt;b>Phần chính&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>trong&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>ứng dụng&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>-&lt;/> hộp thoại của máy scan không mở ra, và áp dụng tùy chỉnh đã đặt trong ứng dụng.
&lt;b>Phần mở rộng&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>trong&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>hộp thoại&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>của máy scan&lt;/> - hiển thị hộp thoại của máy scan, trong đó có thể đặt các tùy chỉnh bổ sung khác dành riêng cho thiết bị.
</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>&lt;b>Basic&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>settings:&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> Do not display the scanner dialog box and apply the settings specified in the application. 
&lt;b>Advanced&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>settings:&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> Display the scanner dialog box to configure additional device-specific settings.
</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>&lt;b>Basic&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>settings:&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> Do not display the scanner dialog box and apply the settings specified in the application. 
&lt;b>Advanced&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>settings:&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> Display the scanner dialog box to configure additional device-specific settings.
</value>
          </title>
          <formatted>true</formatted>
          <type>Label</type>
          <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
          <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
