      <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
        <name>MainGroup3</name>
        <id>81</id>
        <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
          <name>ScanningParametersGroup</name>
          <id>38</id>
          <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
            <name>Resolution</name>
            <id>14</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Resolution</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>دستور</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Autorizzazione</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Zezwolenie</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Разрешение</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>İzin</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Cho phép</value>
            </title>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
              <segments>Resolution</segments>
            </dataPath>
            <toolTip>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>p</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>p</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>р</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>p</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>p</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>p</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTip>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>p</value>
            </toolTip>
            <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>ResolutionExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>72</id>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>&lt;b>200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> is enough to send images by email or fax, post them on websites, or view them on the screen.
&lt;b>300&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> is suitable for most documents and images and for text recognition.
&lt;b>600&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> is suitable for scanning color images of publication quality. You can later print them on a high-quality or large-format printer. Such images take up a large amount of space.
&lt;b>1200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> is suitable for scanning professional photos of publication quality. Such images take up a large amount of space.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>&lt;b>200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> برای ارسال تصاویر با ایمیل یا فکس، انتشار در وب‌سایت‌ها یا مشاهده روی صفحه کافی است.
&lt;b>300&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> برای بیشتر اسناد و تصاویر و برای تشخیص متن مناسب است.
&lt;b>600&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> برای اسکن تصاویر رنگی با کیفیت انتشار مناسب است. بعداً می‌توانید آن‌ها را با چاپگر باکیفیت یا قطع بزرگ چاپ کنید. چنین تصاویری فضای زیادی اشغال می‌کنند.
&lt;b>1200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> برای اسکن عکس‌های حرفه‌ای با کیفیت انتشار مناسب است. چنین تصاویری فضای زیادی اشغال می‌کنند.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>&lt;b>200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> достаточно для отправки изображений по электронной почте, факсу, размещения на сайте или просмотра на экране.
&lt;b>300&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> подходит для большинства документов и изображений, а также для распознавания текста.
&lt;b>600&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> подходит для сканирования цветных изображений типографского качества, которые потом можно вывести на высококачественном или широкоформатном принтере. Изображения занимают большой объем.
&lt;b>1200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> для сканирования профессиональных фотографий типографского качества. Изображения занимают большой объем.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>&lt;b>200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/>, görselleri e-posta ile göndermek, fakslamak, bir web sitesine göndermek veya ekranda görüntülemek için yeterlidir.
&lt;b>300&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/>, çoğu belge ve görselin yanı sıra metin tanılama için de uygundur.
&lt;b>600&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/>, daha sonra yüksek kaliteli veya geniş formatlı bir yazıcıdan çıktı alınabilecek baskı kalitesinde renkli görsellerin taranması için uygundur. Görseller büyük miktarda yer kaplar.
&lt;b>1200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/>, profesyonel baskı kalitesinde fotoğraf taramak içindir. Görüntüler büyük miktarda yer kaplar.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>&lt;b>200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> đủ để gửi hình ảnh qua email, fax, đăng lên trang web hoặc xem trên màn hình.
&lt;b>300&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> phù hợp đối với phần lớn chứng từ và hình ảnh, cũng như để nhận dạng nội dung.
&lt;b>600&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> phù hợp để quét hình ảnh màu chất lượng in, sau đó có thể xuất ra máy in chất lượng cao hoặc máy in khổ rộng. Hình ảnh chiếm nhiều không gian.
&lt;b>1200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> để quét các bức ảnh chuyên nghiệp, chất lượng in. Hình ảnh chiếm nhiều không gian.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>&lt;b>200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> is enough to send images by email or fax, post them on websites, or view them on the screen.
&lt;b>300&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> is suitable for most documents and images and for text recognition.
&lt;b>600&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> is suitable for scanning color images of publication quality. You can later print them on a high-quality or large-format printer. Such images take up a large amount of space.
&lt;b>1200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> is suitable for scanning professional photos of publication quality. Such images take up a large amount of space.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>&lt;b>200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> is enough to send images by email or fax, post them on websites, or view them on the screen.
&lt;b>300&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> is suitable for most documents and images and for text recognition.
&lt;b>600&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> is suitable for scanning color images of publication quality. You can later print them on a high-quality or large-format printer. Such images take up a large amount of space.
&lt;b>1200&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>dpi&lt;/> is suitable for scanning professional photos of publication quality. Such images take up a large amount of space.</value>
              </title>
              <formatted>true</formatted>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
